    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38801" root="مكت" body-key="m">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَتَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكُتَ</span></b> ,] <i>He remained, stayed, abode,</i>
or <i>dwelt,</i> in a place: (K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَدَ</span>: accord. to
some, a word mispronounced: accord. to others
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَثَ</span>; the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span> being changed into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>. (TA.)

